{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>תחטאני</b> — He likened the occurrence that befalls the soul to the plague of tzara'at in the body; therefore: <i>תחטאני באזוב</i> (You shall purge me with hyssop)." "<b>And the word אלבין</b> — from the standing verbs [i.e., intransitive/active], <i>הלבינו שריגיה</i> (its branches grew white)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 51, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:33.298509274Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}